{"id":"n87960-1-7","stage":5,"title":"혹평 · 苛刻评价","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87960-1-7-1","ko":"왜 이렇게 의기소침해 있어?","zh":"怎么这么沮丧啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"의기소침해","meaning":"意气消沉，丧气","explanation":"의기소침하다：意气消沉，丧气；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"의기소침하다","audio":"/audio/c623374c5bb80bb17b89.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71650","senseId":"1","lemma":"의기소침하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"의기소침해","audio":"/audio/df3e1f5499dcd8d154fa.mp3"}},{"text":"있어?","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어","audio":"/audio/675a95c70a831521b983.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"c623374c5bb80bb1","term":"의기소침하다","zh":"意气消沉，丧气","audio":"/audio/c623374c5bb80bb17b89.mp3","entryId":"71650","definiti